    general informational and practical purposes. Tools are provided as-is. A
    tool that performs a calculation or transformation does not guarantee that
    the result is suitable for your particular financial, legal, operational, or
    safety-related decision.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Content on ORIZ.IN, including financial calculators and commentary, is
    educational and is not financial, investment, legal, tax, medical, or other
    professional advice. Financial models use stated assumptions and exclude
    taxes, fees, inflation, and other real-world factors unless explicitly
    described. Verify important results with a qualified professional and the
    primary documents that apply to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>use the site in violation of applicable law;</li>
    <li>attempt to gain unauthorized access to systems or data;</li>
