    <li>input data you do not have the right to process.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Security research and responsible disclosure are welcome. Contact
    <a href={`mailto:${PROFILE.email}?subject=Security%20report`}>{PROFILE.email}</a>
    before taking any action that could affect other users.
  </p>

