  <p>
    Tools rely on modern browser APIs and may produce different results in
    different browsers, locales, time zones, or accessibility configurations.
    Tool pages describe known limitations. You are responsible for reviewing a
    result before relying on it. Do not use the tools for passwords, private
    keys, or sensitive production data unless you have independently assessed
    the risk of doing so in your environment.
  </p>

  <h2>Ads, donations, and commercial relationships</h2>
  <p>
    The site may display clearly labelled advertisements if the operator
    enables an advertising integration. Voluntary donations do not purchase
    content placement, a favourable review, or any guarantee. If sponsored
    content is published in the future, it will be labelled. Advertising and
    sponsorship do not change the editorial standards described in the
    <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, the site and its content are
